    "text": "By Kaitlin McKinley Becker ,\n18 hours ago Two adults died and four children were injured in a crash on Interstate 95 in Maine early Wednesday morning, police said. The crash involved an SUV that had pulled over along the highway in New Gloucester because its trailer had become disconnected, Maine State Police said. Another SUV rear-ended the trailer, which was still partly in the road, and SUV. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
